.PP
.SH "[4\&.0\&.0] (2019-11-02)"
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
automatically wrap and indent help descriptions for options and commands (\fR#1051\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fR\&.exitOverride()\fP allows override of calls to \fRprocess\&.exit\fP for additional error handling and to keep program running (\fR#1040\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
support for declaring required options with \fR\&.requiredOptions()\fP (\fR#1071\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
GitHub Actions support (\fR#1027\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
translation links in README
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
dev: switch tests from Sinon+Should to Jest with major rewrite of tests (\fR#1035\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
call default subcommand even when there are unknown options (\fR#1047\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fIBreaking\fP Commander is only officially supported on Node 8 and above, and requires Node 6 (\fR#1053\fP)
.PP
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fIBreaking\fP keep command object out of program\&.args when action handler called (\fR#1048\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
also, action handler now passed array of unknown arguments
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
complain about unknown options when program argument supplied and action handler (\fR#1049\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
this changes parameters to \fRcommand:*\fP event to include unknown arguments
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
removed deprecated \fRcustomFds\fP option from call to \fRchild_process\&.spawn\fP (\fR#1052\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
rework TypeScript declarations to bring all types into imported namespace (\fR#1081\fP)
.PP
.SS "Migration Tips"
.SS "Testing for no arguments"
If you were previously using code like:

.PP
.PP
.nf
if (!program\&.args\&.length) \&.\&.\&.
.fi
.PP

.PP
a partial replacement is:

.PP
.PP
.nf
if (program\&.rawArgs\&.length < 3) \&.\&.\&.
.fi
.PP
